没错。

1059
00:50:28.920 --> 00:50:30.480
And now it's week eight.
现在已经是第八周了。

1060
00:50:31.500 --> 00:50:35.100
Toby is on his fifth week in a hospital room in Costa Rica.
托比在哥斯达黎加的一间病房里已经住了五个星期。

1061
00:50:35.100 --> 00:50:36.880
Oh, poor Toby, guys.
噢，可怜的托比，伙计们。

1062
00:50:37.100 --> 00:50:37.340
Remember?
还记得吗？

1063
00:50:37.880 --> 00:50:41.320
Toby had his weird moment with Pam, so he moved to Costa Rica.
托比对帕姆做出了一些奇怪的举动，所以他搬到了哥斯达黎加。

1064
00:50:41.740 --> 00:50:45.000
And on like his first day, or day, was it like day three?
就在他去的第一天，不对，是哪天来着，第三天吗？

1065
00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:45.120
Day three.
第三天。

1066
00:50:45.120 --> 00:50:46.880
Day three, he went ziplining.
第三天，他去玩了高空滑索。

1067
00:50:47.280 --> 00:50:48.460
And he broke his neck.
然后他摔断了脖子。

1068
00:50:48.680 --> 00:50:48.920
Yeah.
对。

1069
00:50:49.220 --> 00:50:51.000
He hasn't even been to the beach.
他甚至都还没去过海滩。

1070
00:50:51.560 --> 00:50:54.340
Did you notice what was playing on the TV in the hospital room?
你们注意到病房里的电视在放什么节目了吗？

1071
00:50:54.580 --> 00:50:55.240
Yes, I did.
是的，我注意到了。

1072
00:50:55.240 --> 00:50:58.540
It is the hug it out, bitch, episode of Entourage.
那是《明星伙伴》里“抱头痛哭，碧池”那一集。

1073
00:50:59.180 --> 00:51:03.240
That is the episode of Entourage that Michael quotes in The Coup.
那就是迈克尔在《政变》那一集里引用的《明星伙伴》剧集。

1074
00:51:03.520 --> 00:51:07.940
Well, I have a little location breakdown for you about Toby's hospital room.
好了，我这里有一个关于托比病房取景地的小解析。

1075
00:51:08.060 --> 00:51:08.680
Give it to me.
快告诉我吧。

1076
00:51:08.880 --> 00:51:10.900
It was also filmed at USC.
它也是在南加州大学拍摄的。

1077
00:51:11.420 --> 00:51:11.900
Oh!
噢！

1078
00:51:12.140 --> 00:51:12.480
Yeah.
是啊。

1079
00:51:12.580 --> 00:51:17.480
While they were there filming Pam's Art School, they used the USC television stage building.
当他们在那里拍摄帕姆的美术学校时，他们使用了南加州大学的电视摄影棚大楼。

1080
00:51:17.640 --> 00:51:21.580
And USC asked if eight of their film students could intern and help that day.
南加州大学询问是否可以有八名电影专业的学生在那天实习并帮忙。

1081
00:51:21.760 --> 00:51:23.640
They had interns in all of the different departments.
他们在所有不同的部门都有实习生。

1082
00:51:23.640 --> 00:51:26.520
And our crew said they did a phenomenal job.
我们的剧组说他们干得太棒了。

1083
00:51:26.720 --> 00:51:28.140
That is so cool.
太酷了。

1084
00:51:28.340 --> 00:51:28.720
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1085
00:51:29.200 --> 00:51:35.980
Before we go, I just want to give a shout out to whoever the guy is in the bed next to Toby.
在结束之前，我只想向躺在托比病床旁边的那位仁兄致敬。

1086
00:51:36.520 --> 00:51:38.180
He was a background performer.
他是一名群众演员。

1087
00:51:38.440 --> 00:51:43.480
Angela, I tried so hard to figure out who this is because he is so funny.
安吉拉，我费了好大劲想弄清楚他是谁，因为他太搞笑了。

1088
00:51:43.880 --> 00:51:50.660
He just stares into the camera the whole time Toby is talking.
在托比说话的整个过程中，他一直盯着镜头。

1089
00:51:50.880 --> 00:51:52.100
It is so good.
太精彩了。

1090
00:51:52.100 --> 00:51:53.920
I watched it three times.
我看了三遍。

1091
00:51:54.040 --> 00:52:00.220
I was like, how is this guy doing such a great job with no words?
我在想，这家伙怎么能在一句台词都没有的情况下把角色演得这么好？

1092
00:52:00.300 --> 00:52:01.400
I was so impressed.
我印象太深刻了。

1093
00:52:01.560 --> 00:52:02.920
We couldn't figure out who he was.
我们没能查出他是谁。

1094
00:52:03.020 --> 00:52:04.560
We reached out to several people.
我们联系了好几个人。

1095
00:52:04.820 --> 00:52:05.260
Yes.
是的。

1096
00:52:05.440 --> 00:52:07.440
And I checked everywhere you can check.
我能查的地方都查过了。

1097
00:52:07.600 --> 00:52:09.240
He is uncredited in the episode.
他在这一集中没有演职员署名。

1098
00:52:10.140 --> 00:52:11.040
Phenomenal job.
表现太惊艳了。

1099
00:52:11.280 --> 00:52:12.340
Way to crush it.
干得漂亮。

1100
00:52:12.700 --> 00:52:16.700
And you guys, that was weight loss part two.
各位，这就是减重比赛（第二部分）。

1101
00:52:16.700 --> 00:52:21.000
Oh, there's so many folks to thank for helping us get this episode out to you.
哦，有太多人需要感谢，是他们帮我们把这一集节目带给大家的。

1102
00:52:21.160 --> 00:52:26.680
First of all, our crew that participated in the DVD commentary, Randy Cordray, Michael Gallenberg,
首先是参与DVD随片评论的工作人员，兰迪·科德雷、迈克尔·盖伦伯格，

1103
00:52:26.820 --> 00:52:32.320
Brian Whittle, Nick Carbone, Ben Patrick, Alicia Raycraft, Kelly Cantley, and Jake OuSt.
布莱恩·惠特尔、尼克·卡尔通、本·帕特里克、艾丽西亚·雷克罗夫特、凯利·坎特利和杰克·奥斯特。

1104
00:52:32.820 --> 00:52:33.320
Amazing.
太棒了。

1105
00:52:33.600 --> 00:52:34.520
Best commentary.
最棒的评论。

1106
00:52:34.940 --> 00:52:38.180
Really such a good listen if you love behind-the-scenes information.
如果你喜欢幕后花絮，听这个真的收获满满。

1107
00:52:38.180 --> 00:52:41.520
And James O'Carri for letting us bug you with questions.
还有詹姆斯·奥卡里，谢谢你让我们用各种问题烦你。

1108
00:52:42.140 --> 00:52:42.980
Yeah, we did.
对，我们确实这么做了。

1109
00:52:43.060 --> 00:52:43.920
We did bug him.
我们确实烦他了。

1110
00:52:44.040 --> 00:52:44.540
We did.
我们确实有。

1111
00:52:44.720 --> 00:52:45.460
And Joya Balfour.
还有乔亚·巴尔弗。

1112
00:52:45.620 --> 00:52:46.140
Oh my gosh.
哦天哪。

1113
00:52:46.140 --> 00:52:52.020
I'm so excited to share all of that NBC.com website stuff about Angela and Andy.
我很兴奋能分享所有关于安吉拉和安迪的NBC.com网站内容。

1114
00:52:52.200 --> 00:52:53.760
And then Greg Daniels.
然后是格雷格·丹尼尔斯。

1115
00:52:53.800 --> 00:52:54.160
Yes.
是的。

1116
00:52:54.160 --> 00:52:54.780
Thank you.
谢谢你。

1117
00:52:54.940 --> 00:52:57.600
And also, Paul Feig for that audio clip.
还有，保罗·费格提供的音频剪辑。

1118
00:52:57.780 --> 00:53:00.180
I promise not to bother you too much, Paul Feig.
我保证不会太打扰你，保罗·费格。

1119
00:53:00.540 --> 00:53:02.360
Well, we probably will.
好吧，我们大概还是会打扰的。

1120
00:53:02.640 --> 00:53:03.300
I know.
我知道。

1121
00:53:03.360 --> 00:53:04.440
Why am I making that promise?
我干嘛要做出这种保证？

1122
00:53:04.600 --> 00:53:07.740
But we appreciate our cast and crew so much.
但我们非常感激我们的演员和剧组。

1123
00:53:07.800 --> 00:53:09.580
We hope you enjoyed this one.
希望你们喜欢这一集。

1124
00:53:09.680 --> 00:53:11.640
And we are kicking off season five.
我们要开始第五季了。

1125
00:53:11.760 --> 00:53:13.160
We'll be back for more next week.
我们下周还会带来更多内容。

1126
00:53:13.260 --> 00:53:13.780
We sure will.
我们一定会回来的。

1127
00:53:14.020 --> 00:53:20.680
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies Second Drink.
感谢收听《办公室女士：第二杯》。

1128
00:53:20.880 --> 00:53:24.580
This episode was initially created in collaboration with Earwolf.
本集最初是与Earwolf合作制作的。

1129
00:53:24.580 --> 00:53:29.720
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》是奥德赛（Odyssey）的节目，由珍娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金赛制作。

1130
00:53:29.940 --> 00:53:32.120
Our executive producer is Cassie Jerkins.
我们的执行制作人是卡西·杰金斯。

1131
00:53:32.360 --> 00:53:35.520
And our audio engineer and associate producer is Molly Nugent.
我们的音频工程师兼副制作人是莫莉·纽金特。

1132
00:53:35.820 --> 00:53:38.380
Odyssey's executive producer is Leah Reese Dennis.
奥德赛的执行制作人是莉亚·里斯·丹尼斯。

1133
00:53:38.920 --> 00:53:41.580
Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.
《办公室女士》由比尔·舒尔茨进行混音和母带处理。

1134
00:53:41.700 --> 00:53:44.500
Our theme song is Rubber Tree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿演唱的《橡胶树》。
